Package: deepin-doctor
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 deepin-doctor-daemon (= ${binary:Version}),
 qml-module-qtquick2 | qt6-quick-private-dev,
 qml-module-qtquick-controls2 | qt6-quickcontrols2-dev,
 qml-module-qtquick-layouts | qt6-quicklayouts-dev,
 qml-module-qtquick-window2 | qt6-quickwindow-dev
Description: Deepin System Diagnostic Tool - Frontend GUI
 deepin-doctor is a comprehensive system diagnostic tool for Deepin OS.
 It provides a user-friendly graphical interface to diagnose and fix
 common system issues, including network problems, system errors,
 and environment configuration issues.
 .
 This package provides the Qt Quick based frontend GUI application.

Package: deepin-doctor-daemon
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 libqt5dbus5 | libqt6dbus6
Description: Deepin System Diagnostic Tool - Backend Daemon
 deepin-doctor-daemon is the backend service for the deepin-doctor
 system diagnostic tool. It runs with system privileges to perform
 diagnostics and apply fixes.
 .
 This package provides the system daemon that handles privileged
 operations via D-Bus interface.
